{"answer_text":"Bootstrapped startups should keep costs predictable and avoid tools they'll outgrow in six months. Worth a look: [1]\n\n- **Northwind CRM Essentials**: The safe all-rounder: deep reporting and a large integration marketplace. [2]\n- **Orbitly**: A work-management app many small agencies bend into a lightweight CRM. [3]\n- **Pipewell Go**: Pipeline-first and very visual; a good pick if your process is mostly deal stages. [4]\n\nIn short, trial Northwind CRM and Orbitly side by side with a real week of deals — the better fit is usually obvious by Friday.","answer_uid":"01a1f315-50b5-7140-b82c-7d5cf267e1e9","brand_id":"01a1f315-4dca-7769-a972-a260bfb8c145","collection_mode":"api","cost_usd":0.0051,"created_at":"2026-11-18T08:00:31.850Z","engine":"perplexity","extraction_status":"ok","extras":null,"fanouts":["startup crm free plan","crm for bootstrapped startups"],"latency_ms":5580,"location_applied":true,"market_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-88a2eb448ab7","market_name":"Canada","mentions":[{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889a7fe6de41","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":1,"method":"alias","name":"Northwind CRM","name_text":"Northwind CRM","offsets":[[122,135],[441,454]],"pos":1,"recommended":true,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"positive","sentiment_reason":"Presented as a strong option with concrete strengths."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889e8624eae8","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":2,"method":"alias","name":"Orbitly","name_text":"Orbitly","offsets":[[232,239],[459,466]],"pos":2,"recommended":false,"relation":"indirect","sentiment":"neutral","sentiment_reason":"Listed factually without praise or criticism."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889b1141e640","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":3,"method":"alias","name":"Pipewell","name_text":"Pipewell","offsets":[[322,330]],"pos":3,"recommended":false,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"positive","sentiment_reason":"Presented as a strong option with c